e will be able to work out  there are enough clues in the game that  if you know what you're doing  you can always win so i hope people have  a bit of fun with that  thank you for playing along with me and  i hope people out there can  take on the challenge and learn what  patton is hiding within this simple game  thanks so much eddie for speaking with  me today it's just a pleasure  you two rebecca i take the best of all  the best with this book  every school in the country and um  rebecca thank you  for putting such time and care and love  into writing this  it was a huge privilege to work with you  and be the subject of it so  thank you no worries
 

